I was walking slowly on the hilly path.
The path was very beautiful.
Some tourists were taking their pictures there.
I stopped to rest.
Suddenly, I heard a noise.
I looked ahead.
A monkey was sitting on the wall.
He looked very mischievous.
Nearby, a man was looking at his phone.
That man was wearing a red hat on his head.
The monkey suddenly jumped down.
It snatched that man's hat!
The man tried to catch his hat.
But the monkey was very fast.
It climbed the tree with his hat.
Everyone standing there started laughing loudly.
But I felt a little scared.
I held my bag tightly.
I also put my chikki inside the bag.
Then I carefully moved forward on my path.
